to con soya en Latinoamérica:** Una ficha del producto PROESSE PRO lista citrato de calcio, óxido de magnesio, soya, proteína de, vitamina D entre sus sustancias, pero no es BeWell Cen.\n\nPara información sobre BeWell Cen, conviene buscar la ficha del fabricante o el registro sanitario del país donde se comercializa, y consultar a un profesional de salud antes de usar suplementos de isoflavonas."],"durationSeconds":6.295699959,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_012QLEfbKXi13a9DX4cmesX6","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012Maz1un7ubaDbjEzB2XaHF","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"site:reddit.com menopause soy isoflavones hot flashes worked\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"friday favorites are menopausal hot flashes inevitable how can soy foods help\",\"url\":\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/friday-favorites-are-menopausal-hot-flashes-inevitable-how-can-soy-foods-help/\"},{\"title\":\"friday favorites are menopausal hot flashes inevitable how can soy foods help\",\"url\":\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/friday-favorites-are-menopausal-hot-flashes-inevitable-how-can-soy-foods-help.\"},{\"title\":\"nutritionfacts.org\",\"url\":\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/soy-\"},{\"title\":\"friday favorites are menopausal hot flashes inevitable how can soy foods help\",\"url\":\"https://new.nutritionfacts.org/video/friday-favorites-are-menopausal-hot-flashes-inevitable-how-can-soy-foods-help/\"},{\"title\":\"soy foods for menopause hot flash symptoms\",\"url\":\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/soy-foods-for-menopause-hot-flash-symptoms/\"},{\"title\":\"Does soy food consumption explain why Japanese women appear to be so protected from hot flash symptoms?\",\"url\":\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/Soy-Phytoestrogens-for-Menopause-Hot-Flashes/\"},{\"title\":\"Does soy food consumption explain why Japanese women appear to be so protected from hot flash symptoms?\",\"url\":\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/soy-phytoestrogens-for-menopause-hot-flashes/\"},{\"title\":\"Soy Isoflavones Help Reduce Hot Flashes\",\"url\":\"https://pcrm.org/news/health-nutrition/soy-isoflavones-help-reduce-hot-flashes\"},{\"title\":\"soy hot flashes\",\"url\":\"https://webmd.com/women/features/soy-hot-flashes\"},{\"title\":\"Overall User Ratings\",\"url\":\"https://symptoms.webmd.com/vitamins-supplements/ingredientreview-975-SOY.aspx?print=true\"},{\"title\":\"Fighting Hot Flashes With Diet\",\"url\":\"https://www.pcrm.org/HotFlashes\"},{\"title\":\"hot flushes night sweats brain fog heres what we know about phytoestrogens for menopausal symptoms 204801\",\"url\":\"https://theconversation.com/hot-flushes-night-sweats-brain-fog-heres-what-we-know-about-phytoestrogens-for-menopausal-symptoms-204801\"},{\"title\":\"Back to Living Real Change\",\"url\":\"https://www.piedmont.org/living-better/menopause-news-%28hot%29-flash-soy-not-helpful-at-all\"},{\"title\":\"Soy for Menopause Symptoms\",\"url\":\"https://www.healthlinkbc.ca/healthwise/soy-menopause-symptoms\"},{\"title\":\"new study soy may alleviate hot flashes\",\"url\":\"https://www.onegreenplanet.org/news/new-study-soy-may-alleviate-hot-flashes/\"},{\"title\":\"The Specific Menopause Symptom Soy Isoflavones Actually Help With\",\"url\":\"https://www.mindbodygreen.com/articles/new-study-soy-isoflavones-symptom-relief\"},{\"title\":\"Can Soy and a Low-Fat, Vegan Diet Really Stop Hot Flashes?\",\"url\":\"https://vajenda.substack.com/p/can-soy-and-a-low-fat-vegan-diet\"},{\"title\":\"Plant-derived supplements for menopausal symptoms Original paper\",\"url\":\"https://examine.com/research-feed/study/dBlGe0\"}]\n\nThe search returned no Reddit threads, so I couldn't find first-hand user experiences there. The `site:reddit.com` operator didn't filter the results, and every hit came from health sites, blogs, and review pages.\n\nThe evidence on soy isoflavones and hot flashes is mixed:\n\n- **Positive:** A meta-analysis found that women taking soy isoflavone supplements for six weeks to 12 months reduced the frequency of hot flashes by 21 percent, compared with women taking a placebo. Another summary says isoflavones, soy, and other herbal products (but not red clover) improved the frequency of hot flashes.\n- **Dietary soy:** One 12-week study of a soy-rich, plant-based diet reported large reductions, but the source says in previous randomized trials, soy products have been shown to modestly reduce the frequency of hot flashes. Another review found that for dietary isoflavones (flour, powder, or beverages), the conclusion was there was no good data to support a reduction in hot flashes/night sweats in the Cochrane review it cites.\n- **Negative:** A critical piece argues that soy didn't move the needle on hot flashes or mood symptoms, though it found benefits for vaginal dryness. It also notes that the effectiveness of soy isoflavones may vary person to person.\n- **Anecdotes:** Patient reviews on WebMD are mixed. One user said a 40 mg isoflavone supplement was effective in reducing the intensity and number hot flashes I got during the day.\n\nOverall, the studies point to a modest effect that may vary by person, and the evidence for whole-food soy is weaker than for isoflavone supplements. If you want the Reddit perspective specifically, a search without the site operator, or searching the Reddit site directly, may return threads.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"62f71c28-0593-4b58-9060-c4b9304e6eb2","uuid":"2f32bab2-6538-487b-b6e7-91c55b03c835","timestamp":"2026-11-20T01:57:07.659Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"site:reddit.com menopause soy isoflavones hot flashes worked","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_011Y1BAcjsVEVEzgoUfi18WV","content":[{"title":"friday favorites are menopausal hot flashes inevitable how can soy foods help","url":"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/friday-favorites-are-menopausal-hot-flashes-inevitable-how-can-soy-foods-help/"},{"title":"friday favorites are menopausal hot flashes inevitable how can soy foods help","url":"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/friday-favorites-are-menopausal-hot-flashes-inevitable-how-can-soy-foods-help."},{"title":"nutritionfacts.org","url":"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/soy-"},{"title":"friday favorites are menopausal hot flashes inevitable how can soy foods help","url":"https://new.nutritionfacts.org/video/friday-favorites-