, built around three key pillars: nutrition, emotional well-being and physical well-being. It has no evident link to CEN.\n- **\"Etapas de cambio\":** The only match is a 2006 CDC article on the transtheoretical model, also called the stages of change model, which is a behavior-change framework. It doesn't relate to the product.\n\nIf you need the vanilla flavor specifically, the CEN product page or retailer listings would be the next place to check.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"62f71c28-0593-4b58-9060-c4b9304e6eb2","uuid":"ba36ddb1-3a88-49f4-b46c-a672570400dc","timestamp":"2026-11-20T01:57:18.703Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"\"BeWell\" \"Cen\" etapas de cambio vainilla","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01WXEEwNwckk92JKBD8FZppT","content":[{"title":"BeWell, el programa de bienestar integral de Danone para sus empleados","url":"https://prevencionar.com/2023/07/10/bewell-el-programa-de-bienestar-integral-de-danone-para-sus-empleados/"},{"title":"Be Well","url":"https://www.colbewell.com/"},{"title":"Bewell Consulting Sl - CIF y dirección","url":"https://empresite.eleconomista.es/BEWELL-CONSULTING.html"},{"title":"BEWELL: Habit Reset","url":"https://sergioturbeth.com/pages/bewell-habit-reset"},{"title":"BEWELL - Reloj de madera hecho a mano con correa ligera de madera ajustable, reloj de pulsera de cuarzo de moda casual natural, Madera de nogal, Pequeño : Amazon.com.mx: Ropa, Zapatos y Accesorios","url":"https://www.amazon.com.mx/Bewell-pulsera-natural-mecanismo-ajustable/dp/B07P6668LZ"},{"title":"BeWell Center","url":"https://www.ucjc.edu/en/bewell-center/"},{"title":"Manage Your Account - BeWell, New Mexico's Health Insurance Marketplace","url":"https://bewellnm.com/account/"},{"title":"Sobre nosotros - Bewell Labs","url":"https://bewell-labs.com/sobre-nosotros/"},{"title":"05 0218 es","url":"https://www.cdc.gov/pcd/issueS/2006/jul/05_0218_es.h