{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BCG6uEdkfkQHujS6upQZA2","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Revival soy protein menopause reviews hot flashes taste\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Revival Soy for Menopause Relief | Soy For Weight Loss | Soy For Heart Health | Soy For Skin/Hair/Nail Health\",\"url\":\"https://vimeo.com/149431354\"},{\"title\":\"revival produces soy products for menopause relief\",\"url\":\"https://www.digitaljournal.com/pr/revival-produces-soy-products-for-menopause-relief\"},{\"title\":\"Revival's Shakes Boast Doctor-formulated Soy Protein as Key Component\",\"url\":\"https://www.trendhunter.com/trends/menopause-products\"},{\"title\":\"www.cbn.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.cbn.com/health/SoyResearchCenter/perimenopause.aspx\"},{\"title\":\"www.cbn.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.cbn.com/health/nutrition/3pause.aspx\"},{\"title\":\"soy hot flashes\",\"url\":\"https://webmd.com/women/features/soy-hot-flashes\"},{\"title\":\"Soy Shakes For Energy | Soy For Women's Health | Soy For Healthy Hair | Soy For Workouts | Soy Shakes To Lose Weight\",\"url\":\"https://vimeo.com/173283628\"},{\"title\":\"The Christian Broadcasting Network\",\"url\":\"https://nv.cbn.com/health/nutrition/perimenopause.aspx\"},{\"title\":\"The Christian Broadcasting Network\",\"url\":\"https://nv.cbn.com/health/nutrition/3pause.aspx\"},{\"title\":\"Close Menu\",\"url\":\"https://www.todaysdietitian.com/womens-health-are-menopause-supplements-effective/\"},{\"title\":\"The #1 High-Protein Drink to Help Ease Hot Flashes, According to Dietitians\",\"url\":\"https://www.aol.com/1-high-protein-drink-help-000000055.html\"},{\"title\":\"Close Menu\",\"url\":\"https://www.todaysdietitian.com/newarchives/0316p18.shtml\"},{\"title\":\"friday favorites are menopausal hot flashes inevitable how can soy foods help\",\"url\":\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/friday-favorites-are-menopausal-hot-flashes-inevitable-how-can-soy-foods-help.\"},{\"title\":\"A 11063416\",\"url\":\"https://www.target.com/p/estroven-menopause-relief-stress-supplement-caplets-28ct/-/A-11063416\"},{\"title\":\"Fighting Hot Flashes With Diet\",\"url\":\"https://www.pcrm.org/HotFlashes\"},{\"title\":\"Overall User Ratings\",\"url\":\"https://symptoms.webmd.com/vitamins-supplements/ingredientreview-975-SOY.aspx?print=true\"}]\n\nThe results have little independent review data on Revival specifically. Most of it is brand marketing, and the broader soy research is mixed.\n\n**Taste:** Revival's own materials say the brand focuses on flavor, and it won't release a product until it tastes good to consumers. A press release says customers often find the protein shake or bar reduces the soy taste. Neither source is an independent taste test.\n\n**Hot flashes:** Revival's claims come from its own team and affiliated outlets. One CBN article by a Revival medical research director reports significant decreases in frequency and intensity of hot flashes, night sweats, fatigue and other menopausal symptoms after 6 weeks of daily Revival Soy use. Revival's video cites a Johns Hopkins study, but I couldn't confirm that study's details from these results.\n\n**Broader evidence is mixed:** A Cochrane review found no conclusive evidence that phytoestrogens effectively reduce the frequency or severity of hot flashes. Other research is more favorable. A study in the journal Menopause found a plant-based diet rich in soy reduces moderate-to-severe hot flashes, and a source on soy protein notes that consuming 20 g to 60 g per day of soy protein modestly decreases the frequency and severity of hot flashes.\n\n**Bottom line:** Revival's marketing is strong on taste and hot-flash claims, but I found no independent Revival-specific reviews or trials. Soy protein may modestly help some women, and the evidence is inconsistent. Search for independent trials or user reviews on retailer sites for a more balanced view.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"62f71c28-0593-4b58-9060-c4b9304e6eb2","uuid":"3ea74efa-915c-4516-bf84-e5be06c76364","timestamp":"2026-11-20T01:57:57.435Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Revival soy protein menopause reviews hot flashes taste","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01ChJj7JLR7szk9SGfpNKj9b","content":[{"title":"Revival Soy for Menopause Relief | Soy For Weight Loss | Soy For Heart Health | Soy For Skin/Hair/Nail Health","url":"https://vimeo.com/149431354"},{"title":"revival produces soy products for menopause relief","url":"https://www.digitaljournal.com/pr/revival-produces-soy-products-for-menopause-relief"},{"title":"Revival's Shakes Boast Doctor-formulated Soy Protein as Key Component","url":"https://www.trendhunter.com/trends/menopause-products"},{"title":"www.cbn.com","url":"https://www.cbn.com/health/SoyResearchCenter/perimenopause.aspx"},{"title":"www.cbn.com","url":"https://www.cbn.com/health/nutrition/3pause.aspx"},{"title":"soy hot flashes","url":"https://webmd.com/women/features/soy-hot-flashes"},{"title":"Soy Shakes For Energy | Soy For Women's Health | Soy For Healthy Hair | Soy For Workouts | Soy Shakes To Lose Weight","url":"https://vimeo.com/173283628"},{"title":"The Christian Broadcasting Network","url":"https://nv.cbn.com/health/nutrition/perimenopause.aspx"},{"title":"The Christian Broadcasting Network","url":"https://nv.cbn.com/health/nutrition/3pause.aspx"},{"title":"Close Menu","url":"https://www.todaysdietitian.com/womens-health-are-menopause-supplements-effective/"},{"title":"The #1 High-Protein Drink to Help Ease Hot Flashes, According to Dietitians","url":"https://www.aol.com/1-high-protein-drink-help-000000055.html"},{"title":"Close Menu","url":"https://www.todaysdietitian.com/newarchives/0316p18.shtml"},{"title":"friday favorites are menopausal hot flashes inevitable how can soy foods help","url":"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/friday-favorites-are-menopausal-hot-flashes-inevitable-how-can-soy-foods-help."},{"title":"A 11063416","url":"https://www.target.com/p/estroven-menopause-relief-stress-supplement-caplets-28ct/-/A-11063416"},{"title":"Fighting Hot Flashes With Diet","url":"https://www.pcrm.org/HotFlashes"},{"title":"Overall User Ratings","url":"https://symptoms.webmd.com/vitamins-supplements/ingredientreview-975-SOY.aspx?print=true"}]},"The results have little independent review data on Revival specifically. Most of it is brand marketing, and the broader soy research is mixed.\n\n**Taste:** Revival's own materials say the brand focuses on flavor, and it won't release a product until it tastes good to consumers. A press release says customers often find the protein shake or bar reduces the soy taste. Neither source is an independent taste test.\n\n**Hot flashes:** Revival's claims come from its own team and affiliated outlets. One CBN article by a Revival medical research director reports significant decreases in frequency and intensity of hot flashes, night sweats, fatigue and other menopausal symptoms after 6 weeks of daily Revival Soy use. Revival's video cites a Johns Hopkins study, but I couldn't confirm that study's details from these results.\n\n**Broader evidence is mixed:** A Cochrane review found no conclusive evidence that phytoestrogens effectively reduce the frequency or severity of hot flashes. Other research is more favorable. A study in the journal Menopause found a plant-based diet rich in soy reduces moderate-to-severe hot flashes, and a source on soy protein notes that consuming 20 g to 60 g per day of soy protein modestly decreases the frequency and severity of hot flashes.\n\n**Bottom line:** Revival's marketing is strong on taste and hot-flash claims, but I found no independent Revival-specific reviews or trials. Soy protein may modestly help some women, and the evidence is inconsistent. Search for independent trials or user reviews on retailer sites for a more balanced view."],"dur