o x 400 g isoretard tarro x 400 g\",\"url\":\"https://www.farmatodo.com.co/producto/500031703-isoflavones-de-soya-tarro-x-400-g-isoretard-tarro-x-400-g\"},{\"title\":\"www.mercadolibre.cl\",\"url\":\"https://www.mercadolibre.cl/pagina/quinoa2010\"},{\"title\":\"Proteina Vegetal Soya Gohard 1 Kg Doble Dulce De Leche\",\"url\":\"https://www.mercadolibre.cl/shorts/clips/W4SybT/proteina-vegetal-soya-gohard-1-kg-doble-dulce-leche\"}]\n\nThe search didn't turn up a MercadoLibre Colombia listing for a shake marketed for menopause that contains soy isoflavones. The results were mostly adjacent products and general guides.\n\n- **Closest product matches:** A MercadoLibre Colombia store page lists a \"Phyto Estrogen Plus\" soy isoflavone capsule product from Medical Green (100 capsules). Another Colombian listing, from a store called Mijoscare, shows a \"Batido Verde\" 750 g vegan soy protein powder with oat and spirulina, but it doesn't mention menopause. A MercadoLibre Colombia blog guide on homemade protein shakes notes that protein powders are often made from whey, casein, soy, or plant sources like pea and rice.\n- **Menopause-focused items:** Other results are capsule supplements that combine soy isoflavones with maca and black cohosh, sold on MercadoLibre Mexico, and a Farmatodo Colombia listing for 80 mg soy isoflavone capsules.\n- **Evidence context:** A Tua Saúde article says soy isoflavones are studied for hot flashes, and that supplements concentrate doses more precisely but don't always match the effect of whole food. Its suggestions include soy drink without added sugar. A Rappi page makes broader health claims about isoflavones, including bone and cardiovascular benefits, but those are marketing-style statements rather than clinical findings.\n\nIf you want a shake specifically, a follow-up search for a MercadoLibre Colombia soy protein or menopause shake listing, or for clinical evidence on soy isoflavones for hot flashes, would be the next step.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"62f71c28-0593-4b58-9060-c4b9304e6eb2","uuid":"97c698cb-7d48-43a8-bc44-31e2b57d71d1","timestamp":"2026-11-20T01:57:59.052Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"mercadolibre.com.co batido proteína menopausia isoflavonas soya","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01QnrdXXHnzeW8B18eMQqPrm","content":[{"title":"www.mercadolibre.com.mx","url":"https://www.mercadolibre.com.mx/isologic-bodylogic/up/MLMU4667012427"},{"title":"Te recomendamos algunos","url":"https://www.mercadolibre.com.co/blog/como-preparar-un-batido-de-proteina-casero-paso-a-paso"},{"title":"CODIGO MENSTRUAL","url":"https://www.mercadolibre.com.mx/tienda/codigo-menstrual"},{"title":"www.mercadolibre.com.ar","url":"https://www.mercadolibre.com.ar/pagina/opositivehealth"},{"title":"www.mercadolibre.com.co","url":"https://www.mercadolibre.com.co/blog/proteina/1"},{"title":"• Tua Saúde","url":"https://www.tuasaude.com/es/news/?p=12622"},{"title":"www.mercadolibre.com.co","url":"https://www.mercadolibre.com.co/pagina/mijoscare"},{"title":"www.farmacity.com","url":"https://www.farmacity.com/suplemento-dietario-para-menopausia-x-60-un/p"},{"title":"Isoflavonas De Soya 80 Mg Natural Systems Frasco X 60 Sofgel Natural Systems Frasco X 60","url":"https://www.farmatodo.com.co/producto/500014269-isoflavonas-de-soya-80-mg-natural-systems-frasco-x-60-sofgel-natural-systems-frasco-x-60"},{"title":"Isoflavonas De Soya Suplemento Alimenticios C/90 Capsulas Nutricion 2000","url":"https://www.rappi.com.mx/p/isoflavonas-de-soya-suplemento-alim-2374089"},{"title":"www.mercadolibre.com.co","url":"https://www.mercadolibre.com.co/blog/suplementos/1"},{"title":"Medical Green","url":"https://www.mercadolibre.com.co/tienda/medical-green"},{"title":"Salud y equipamiento médico","url":"https://www.mercadolibre.com.co/blog/salud-y-equipamiento-medico/6"},{"title":"BALTA SPORTS","url":"https://www.mercadolibre.c